            "input": "rulebook:site_amr_rules"
          },
          "status": "outside",
          "text": "Personnel detection and stopping in safety-rated control. Personnel detection, speed control near people, braking and emergency stop run in the robot's safety-rated hardware and software, at the performance levels the standards require, not in URML and not in the fleet manager."
