            "field": "obligations.urml_is_not_a_safety_function",
            "input": "rulebook:cell_7_safety"
          },
          "status": "outside",
          "text": "Nothing in URML counts toward a performance level or a SIL. The URML validator and runtimes are not safety-related parts of the control system. They are left out of every performance level and safety integrity level calculation, and no safety function depends on them."
        },
        {
          "detail": {
            "cite": {
              "standard": [
                "IEC 61508-3:2010"
              ],
              "text": "IEC 61508-3:2010, clause 6.2",
              "url": null
            }
          },
          "id": "obligation.cell_7_safety.urml_cannot_interfere",
          "result": null,
          "source": {
            "field": "obligations.urml_cannot_interfere",
            "input": "rulebook:cell_7_safety"
          },
          "status": "outside",
          "text": "URML cannot interfere with safety-related software. If URML runs on hardware that also runs safety-related software, the integrator shows that URML cannot interfere with it, or treats URML as safety-related, which URML does not support. The simpler design keeps URML on separate hardware."
        },
        {
          "detail": {
            "cite": {
              "standard": [
                "ISO 13849-1:2023",
                "IEC 62061:2021",
                "IEC 61508:2010"
              ],
              "text": "ISO 13849-1:2023, IEC 62061:2021 or IEC 61508:2010, clauses 6.2",
              "url": null
            }
          },
          "id": "obligation.cell_7_safety.safety_functions_designed",
          "result": null,
          "source": {
            "field": "obligations.safety_functions_designed",
            "input": "rulebook:cell_7_safety"
          },
          "status": "outside",
          "text": "Each safety function is designed to its required level. Each safety function the risk assessment calls for is specified, designed and implemented in safety-related control to reach its required performance level or safety integrity level."
        },
        {
          "detail": {
            "cite": {
              "standard": [
                "ISO 13849-2",
                "IEC 62061:2021",
                "IEC 61508:2010"
              ],
